Subject: [PATCH 08/10] =?UTF-8?q?elden:=20vk47=20=E2=80=94=20WCD939x=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E9=87=87=E9=9B=86=EF=BC=88=E5=8E=BB=20VA=20DMIC=EF=BC=8C?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=8D=95=20WCD=20capture=20link=EF=BC=89?=
